                            "playtime_at_review": 175,
                            "last_played": 1648690873
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game definitely delivers on the promise of a condensed stealth game experience. The mechanics are simple, and while you only have 2 abilities at your disposal at any given time, just the very act of deciding when to and when not to engage enemies is exciting. If you're not off-put by the game's eccentric art style and apparent lack of professionalism, and just wondering if the gameplay is solid, it absolutely is.",
